# Preserve original source

## Requirement

Switching view modes and preview generation must not modify the original `.iasi` document.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/objectives.md` · Success criteria for the first VS Code milestone
- `inputs/externals/definitions.md` · 4. Editing modes / Source

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
